{"id":"n16444-1-8","stage":2,"title":"상 · 桌子","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16444-1-8-1","ko":"유민아, 이리 와서 상을 차리는 것 좀 도와라.","zh":"裕敏啊，过来帮忙摆一下餐具吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민아,","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}},{"text":"이리","meaning":"往这边，朝这里","explanation":"이리：往这边，朝这里","readings":[{"term":"이리","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91328","senseId":"1","lemma":"이리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이리","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3"}},{"text":"와서","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와서","audio":"/audio/fff1948ffcab0f48d739.mp3"}},{"text":"상을","meaning":"桌子","explanation":"상：桌子；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"상","audio":"/audio/3c2d6ddb4a94f1f36375.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16444","senseId":"1","lemma":"상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상을","audio":"/audio/8a9533d1c73ef1cf459c.mp3"}},{"text":"차리는","meaning":"摆，置办","explanation":"차리다：摆，置办；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"차리다","audio":"/audio/967898219777e9f4fca1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71366","senseId":"1","lemma":"차리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차리는","audio":"/audio/f386e048cb63131fd690.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"도와라.","meaning":"帮，帮助","explanation":"돕다：帮，帮助；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"돕다","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17203","senseId":"1","lemma":"돕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도와라","audio":"/audio/a6d04f18f03a7f475f31.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"062801c7a30dc6ce","term":"이리","zh":"往这边，朝这里","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3","entryId":"91328","definition":"向着这个地方；或向着这个方向。","pronunciation":["이리"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"3c2d6ddb4a94f1f3","term":"상","zh":"桌子","audio":"/audio/3c2d6ddb4a94f1f36375.mp3","entryId":"16444","definition":"摆放饮食或小东西的家具。","pronunciation":["상"]},{"id":"967898219777e9f4","term":"차리다","zh":"摆，置办","audio":"/audio/967898219777e9f4fca1.mp3","entryId":"71366","definition":"把准备好的食物等放在桌上以供食用。","pronunciation":["차리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"7feaaecf170e0c6a","term":"돕다","zh":"帮，帮助","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3","entryId":"17203","definition":"给别人正在做的事打下手或添帮手。","pronunciation":["돕ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5a3792a29ecb2c13a2b9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16444-1-8-2","ko":"알겠어요. 엄마","zh":"好的，妈妈。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"알겠어요.","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：